        Component {
          Type          Subsystem
          Name          "SPI pack"
          Show          on
          Position      [890, 750]
          Direction     up
          Flipped       off
          LabelPosition south
          Frame         [-15, -15; 15, 15]
          SampleTime    "-1"
          CodeGenDiscretizationMethod "2"
          CodeGenTarget "Generic"
          MaskType      "SPI pack"
          MaskDescription "This block packs float data to be sent over SPI. \n"
"\n"
"It interprets an array of floats (32 bits) as an array of unsigned integers ("
"32 bits).\n"
"It then spits each uint32 into two uint16 (16 bits) to be sent over SPI.\n"
"\n"
"The SPI block must be configured to 16 bits per word and the number of words "
"per transmission is double the number of floats to be sent."
